{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114603","id":3144712270,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc67cIBO","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114603","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114603.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114603.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114603","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114603/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114603/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114603/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fe5450298758d86041fc444b4942dfd136312d92","number":114603,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix animation editor sometimes not processing on scene change","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When implementing https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103416, I missed the case that if the AnimationPlayer was not selected when swapping back to the scene, then `make_visible(true)` would not be called on the `AnimationPlayerEditorPlugin`, meaning that `set_process(true)` would not be called on `AnimationPlayerEditor`, which meant the UI would not update. This fixes the issue by calling `plugin->make_visible(true)` just after the call to `edit`, which ensures the state is identical as when we select the node in the Scene Tree panel (see [`EditorNode::_plugin_over_edit`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4036e90a4349740cb86e6245b9e11f38bb436897/editor/editor_node.cpp#L1195-L1205)).\r\n\r\nI also tested and considered just calling `set_process(true)`, but this approach avoids any other potential inconsistencies in how the editor is activated, so I thought it was the more reliable option. Open to thoughts/comments though.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114443","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXL